   "t1": 134,
   "line": "And on the table, the dead phone is warm, as if something inside it is still awake."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S13",
   "a": 970,
   "b": 1077,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 107,
   "line": "So what would you do? Save Ellie, or save the future?"
  },
  {
