   "a": 1120,
   "b": 1170,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 50,
   "line": "And is any of this real?"
  },
  {
   "shot": "S15",
   "a": 1170,
   "b": 1425,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 255,
   "line": "The rules are. No cell network until 1979. No GPS until 1978. No penicillin until 1928."
  },
  {
   "shot": "S19",
   "a": 1425,
   "b": 1529,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 104,
   "line": "A hundred years ago, a computer was a person with a pencil."
